# Everything in this bundle is read inside Linux containers — the scripts under
# bootstrap/ by bash, the configs by nginx, Keycloak and the services — whatever
# OS the checkout is on. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf would otherwise
# hand bash a script ending every line in \r, which fails as
# "$'\r': command not found" on the first line of the bootstrap job.
* text=auto eol=lf
